  "worked_solution": "One of the points belonging to the graph is $(24,10).$\n\nLet's write the ratio $24:10$ as a fraction:\n\n$$\n\\frac{24}{10}\n$$\n\nWe can simplify this fraction by dividing both the numerator and the denominator by $2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{24÷2}{10÷2} & =\\frac{12}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo the ratio of flour to water is $12:5$",
